# calib.expect — P2-3 boot-calibration contrast gate (calibration ON, default).
# Asserts the boot calibration MEASURED and APPLIED the injected raw bias, then flew an
# ALTITUDE_HOLD hover with the ESKF attitude bounded. The "without calibration" half is
# demonstrated by re-running with SILS_EMU_NO_CALIB=1 (see calib.scn) — not gated here.
# 校正 ON（既定）の対照判定。起動校正が注入した生バイアスを測定・適用し、ALT_HOLD
# ホバーを ESKF 姿勢有界で飛んだことを検証する。「校正なし」側は SILS_EMU_NO_CALIB=1 の
# 再実行で実証（ここでは判定しない）。
#
# History: this gate was XFAIL (tracked 2026-07-26): the injected IMU bias combined with the
# ODE plant's takeoff dynamics produced a 0.6-0.7 Hz self-oscillation (simulation-policy backlog
# #4/#13). The 2026-10-02 flip plant fit (torque_authority 0.60, 6 ms delay, 18 duty/s slew;
# SSOT plant_fit_flip_2026_10) damps it and the gate now passes (XPASS), so the marker is removed.
# This is an incidental effect of the fit, not a root-cause fix: re-check if the fit changes.
# 履歴: 本判定は XFAIL だった（2026-07-26 追跡）: 注入 IMU バイアス×ODE プラントの離陸動特性が
# 0.6-0.7Hz の自励振動を生んでいた（バックログ#4/#13）。2026-10-02 の宙返りプラントフィット
# （torque_authority 0.60・遅れ 6 ms・スルーレート 18 duty/s、SSOT plant_fit_flip_2026_10）で
# 抑えられ判定が通る（XPASS）ためマーカーを削除。フィットの副次効果であり根本修正ではない:
# フィットを変えたら再確認すること。
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM accepted"                       # G1: IDLE_GROUND → ARMED_GROUND
log_contains any "Takeoff complete"                   # G1: TAKEOFF → FLYING
log_contains any "Boot calibration applied"           # the calibration measured + seeded the injected bias
log_contains any "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD"  # in-flight ALTITUDE_HOLD engage
log_contains any "DISARM accepted"                    # FLYING → IDLE_GROUND
metric att_rmse < 0.08727 in 10.0 18.0  # 5.0 deg  # G2: with calibration, ESKF attitude tracks truth (bias removed)
metric tilt_max < 0.3142 in 10.0 18.0  # 18.0 deg  # G3: attitude bounded (no tumble)
